    "text": "8.5 Effect of Termination. -18- L-PR/1256533.9 (a) Termination by Skold for CollaGenex’s Breach. In the event this Agreement is terminated by Skold for a material breach of CollaGenex pursuant to Section 8.3, on a Product-by-Product and/or country-by-country basis, as applicable, the following provisions shal] apply: (a) CollaGenex shal] promptly return and/or provide to Skold all Confidential Information of Skold (or if such termination is only with respect to a Product and/oz country, shal] return and/or provide all Confidential Information with respect to such Product and/or country), provided that CollaGenex shall be entitled to retain a copy for archival purposes or as otherwise required by law;"
