    "name": "9.5 Notices",
    "text": "9.5 Notices. Notices to Skold shall be addressed to: Thomas Skold Bjorno Gard S-76] 41 Norrtalje Sweden Facsimile No.: (0046) 176 22 4420 Notices to CollaGenex shall be addressed to: CollaGenex Phannaccuticals, Inc. 41 University Drive, Suite 200 Newtown, Pennsylvania 18940 United States of America Attention: Chief Executive Officer Facsimile No.: (001) 215 579 8577 Either Party may change the address to which notices shall be sent by giving notice lo the other Party in the manner herein provided. Any notice required or provided for by the terms of this Agreement shall be in writing and shall be (i) sent by registered or certified mail, return receipt requested, postage prepaid, (ii) sent via a reputable overnight courier service, or (iii) sent by facsimile transmission, in cach case properly addressed in accordance with the paragraphs above. -21- 1-PR/1256533.9 The effective date of any notice shall be the actual date of reccipt by the Party receiviny the same."
  },
  {
